# Lava Coil on Darksteel Myr (0/1 indestructible): the 4 damage is lethal,
# but CR 702.12b keeps an indestructible permanent out of the lethal-damage
# SBA, so it never would die and the exile-instead replacement never
# applies. The effect card replaceDying made stays in the Command zone until
# the cleanup step ends it (game.getEndOfTurn().addUntil,
# SpellAbilityEffect.java:752); cleanup also removes the damage (CR 514.2).
# By the ai's upkeep both are gone and the Myr is still on the battlefield.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 4
queue action human cast 1
passpriority
advance 11
passpriority
